{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Something magical this way comes\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open your <strong>Book of Shadows</strong> and dive into a charming new expansion for <i>Sticky Business</i> that\u2019s steeped in witchy vibes and cozy spells. From enchanted stickers to spellbinding stories, the <strong>Book of Shadows</strong> DLC brings a bewitching blend of magic, mischief, and heartfelt moments to your sticker shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft the perfect love spell sticker and lovingly wrap them into a mystical bundle of charms and goodies for your favorite customer. The Book of Shadows is here to add a dash of the arcane to your daily sticker hustle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s inside the Book of Shadows?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>83 magical new stickers</strong> (+ 34 charming variations) themed around witchery, potions, familiars, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 new customer stories</strong> exploring themes of love spells, coven friendships, family magic, and the little rituals that make life special</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 mystical new goodies</strong> to tuck into your sticker packages \u2013 from fancy crystals to bewitching keychains </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 new glitter papers</strong> to add some serious sparkle to your spellwork</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time to light a candle, stir your cauldron, and bring a little magic to your sticker business. Let your creativity run wild\u2014the coven is waiting!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639630?t=1748264380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639630/4aa0113f7db0d44ba89abdb61ce6bd5834fea574/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748264380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s